<h1 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:30px; line-height:125%"><span style=3D"col=
or: #192733;">The economics of dog shows</span></h1>
<p style=3D"font-size:18px; line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"font-size:18px; line-height:125%"><span style=3D"color: #192733=
;"><em>Even the participants at the Westminster Dog Show, the best pups in =
the world, are unlikely to make a fortune for their owners.</em></span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:13px; line-height:125%; font-weight:bold">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"font-size:13px; line-height:125%; font-weight:bold"><br><span s=
tyle=3D"color: #192733;">BY <a href=3D"https://d2q-Vf04.na1.hubspotlinks.co=
m/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWSg6n2lt59WW8lTDvM4C1FzMVLsY3L5KgzHXN8XrLD-2_3wqW5BW=
0B06lZ3q2W5rNR208XRJGSW7tV4Ch3mkVl3W6lfGr77TtpH7W6BVwC18P9MpHW6_PNT_1sgKY6W=
7hBqm47DZXVSW8LdmWg8RlQQ0VFcJCj3jxXWpW2zyHjd1hz9LXW6nFmtb85qMbRW3YJrg82-MTJ=
XW247v8_7CFN6jW6nq1dk4dhbvMW64vjcf6T5DPqVV1G9r8K9CpgW1mbkC12PScqnN7cyShySVB=
X-N7R24HhHZZrXf3bT5xn04" style=3D"font-weight:bold; color:#192733; text-dec=
oration:none !important" rel=3D"noopener" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-lin=
k-id-v2=3D"aQ+NAHat" target=3D"_blank">KELLI MAR=C3=8DA KORDUCKI</a></span>=
</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Abigail was exhausted. The six-year-old white=
 bull terrier =E2=80=94 officially known as GCHB Alaric Star Spangled Siste=
r =E2=80=94 had just been declared the best in her breed at the 2026 Westmi=
nster Dog Show.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Now, with a few hours to kill before vying ag=
ainst the other top terriers for the Best in Group title, she was stealing =
a few minutes of rest in her crate. It was an impressive show of composure =
considering the surrounding commotion: the whirr of hair dryers at grooming=
 stations, excited chatter, judging calls blaring from competing PA systems=
, and the occasional bark from any of a few hundred dogs.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Last week, <strong>~2.5k</strong> canines rep=
resenting ~212 breeds and their owners, groomers, trainers, and handlers de=
scended on midtown Manhattan for the Westminster Dog Show, widely known as =
the Super Bowl of dogs. They came from across the country and around the wo=
rld, traveling from as far as Japan, Indonesia, and Peru.</p></div></div></=
td></tr></tbody></table>
<div id=3D"hs_cos_wrapper_module-2-0-1" class=3D"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrap=
per_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style=3D"color: inherit; font-size: =
inherit; line-height: inherit;" data-hs-cos-general-type=3D"widget" data-hs=
